.TH KINTSUGI-MODS 1 "2026-10-22" "kintsugi 0.8.0" "Kintsugi Manual"
.SH NAME
kintsugi-mods \- mod manifests
.SH SYNOPSIS
.B kintsugi mods
list
.br
.B kintsugi mods
trust
.br
.B kintsugi mods
untrust
.br
.B kintsugi mods
call <mod> <tool> <json>
.SH DESCRIPTION
Manage mod manifests. Mods are external tools that extend kintsugi's capabilities.
Project mods must be explicitly trusted before they run.
.SH COMMANDS
.IP \fBlist\fR
Show mod manifests with trust state
.IP \fBtrust\fR
Allow this workspace's project mods to run
.IP \fBuntrust\fR
Revoke this workspace's trust marker
.IP \fBcall\fR
Start one mod and call one of its tools
.SH EXAMPLES
List mods:
.PP
  $ kintsugi mods list
.PP
Trust project mods:
.PP
  $ kintsugi mods trust
.PP
Call a mod tool:
.PP
  $ kintsugi mods call mymod mytool '{"arg": "value"}'
.SH SEE ALSO
.BR kintsugi (1),
.BR kintsugi-hooks (1)
